                                                                         ISOLATION :


Q1. What is Isolation in Spring?
- Isolation defines how one transaction is isolated from other concurrent transactions.
- Matlab: Ek transaction dusre transaction ke data ko kitna aur kaise dekh sakta hai jab dono parallel chal rahe ho..

          Transaction Isolation Levels :
                               - DEFAULT :
                               - READ_UNCOMMITTED
                               - READ_COMMITTED
                               - REPEATABLE_READ
                               - SERIALIZABLE

     Isolation levels solve these problems 👇 :
                               - Dirty Read :
                                        - Read data that is not committed yet.
                                        - ex :
                                                     TRANSACTION-A                                                       TRANSACTION-B
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T1               | Update Book Set bookName="harrypotter" where bookId=1;           |
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T2               |                                                                  | select * from book where bookId=1;
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T3               |                                                                  |
                                                           |                                                                  |


                               - Non-Repeatable Read :
                                        - Same row read twice gives different value.
                                        - ex :
                                                     TRANSACTION-A                                                       TRANSACTION-B
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T1               | select * from book where bookId=1;                               |
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T2               |                                                                  | Update Book Set bookName="harrypotter" where bookId=1;
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T3               | select * from book where bookId=1;                               |
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

                               - Phantom Read :
                                        - New rows appear in second query.
                                        - ex :
                                                     TRANSACTION-A                                                       TRANSACTION-B
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T1               | select * from book where price <100;                             |
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T2               |                                                                  | Insert into Book values(5,"new book",50);
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          T3               | select * from book where price=<100;                             |
                                                           |                                                                  |
                                          --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


                - DEFAULT :
                        - Database ka default isolation level use karo.
                        - Spring Boot / JPA khud koi isolation force nahi karta, balki jo DB ka default hota hai wahi use hota hai.
                        - 🧠 Database Default Isolation Levels :
                                                         | Database     | Default Isolation Level |
                                                         | ------------ | ----------------------- |
                                                         | MySQL InnoDB | REPEATABLE_READ         |
                                                         | PostgreSQL   | READ_COMMITTED          |
                                                         | Oracle       | READ_COMMITTED          |
                                                         | SQL Server   | READ_COMMITTED          |

                - READ_UNCOMMITTED :
                        - Dusre transaction ka uncommitted data bhi padh sakta hai.
                        - Matlab Dirty Read allowed.
                        -  READ_UNCOMMITTED  ->  ❌ Almost No Lock (Very Weak Locking).
                        - Database usually read lock nahi lagata (depends on DB).
                        - Performance: 🔥 Very Fast (No blocking).
                        - ❌ Problems Allowed :
                                          | Problem             | Allowed? |
                                          | ------------------- | -------- |
                                          | Dirty Read          | ✅ Yes   |
                                          | Non-Repeatable Read | ✅ Yes   |
                                          | Phantom Read        | ✅ Yes   |
                        - Example:
                              - System logs 
                              - User activity tracking

                - READ_COMMITTED (Industry Default):
                        - Sirf committed data hi read hoga.
                        - Dirty Read problem solve ho jata hai.
                        - READ_COMMITTED  ->  🔒 Row Level Shared Lock (Read)
                                              🔒 Row Level Exclusive Lock (Write)
                        - Read lock statement level pe hota hai (after read release).
                        - Performance: ⚡ Fast
                        - ❌ Problems Allowed :
                                          | Problem             | Allowed? |
                                          | ------------------- | -------- |
                                          | Dirty Read          | ❌ No    |
                                          | Non-Repeatable Read | ✅ Yes   |
                                          | Phantom Read        | ✅ Yes   |

                - REPEATABLE_READ :
                        - Ek transaction me jo data ek baar read hua,
                        - dobara read karoge to same hi milega (even if someone updated it).
                        - REPEATABLE_READ -> 🔒 Row Lock + 🔒 Gap Lock (Range Lock)
                        - Gap Lock prevents insert between rows.
                        - Performance: ⚡ Medium (slower than READ_COMMITTED).
                        - ❌ Problems Allowed :
                                          | Problem             | Allowed? |
                                          | ------------------- | -------- |
                                          | Dirty Read          | ❌ No    |
                                          | Non-Repeatable Read | ❌ No    |
                                          | Phantom Read        | ✅ Yes   |

                - SERIALIZABLE :
                        - Sab transactions line me ek-ek karke execute hote hai.
                        - Jaise single user system.
                        - SERIALIZABLE -> 🔒 Shared Lock (Read)
                                          🔒 Exclusive Lock (Write)
                                          🔒 Range Lock / Predicate Lock
                                          🔒 Gap Lock
                        - Effectively behaves like Full Table Lock.
                        - Performance: 🐌 Very Slow (No parallelism)
                        - ❌ Problems Allowed :
                                          | Problem             | Allowed? |
                                          | ------------------- | -------- |
                                          | Dirty Read          | ❌ No    |
                                          | Non-Repeatable Read | ❌ No    |
                                          | Phantom Read        | ❌ No    |



🥇 Database Internal Locks :  DB automatically uses:-
                                           🔹 Shared Lock (Read Lock) :
                                                                  - Multiple reads allowed
                                                                  - Write blocked
                                          🔹 Exclusive Lock (Write Lock) :
                                                                  - No one else can read/write.
